[1m[38;5;231mWhere should the user id persist, and for how long?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restart, read explicitly by code that needs it. Manual expiry via a stored timestamp. Not sent to
[39m     [38;5;246mthe server automatically.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Cookie
     [38;5;246mSurvives restart with real Max-Age, and is sent on every same-origin request automatically. Larger CSRF/request [39m
     [38;5;246msurface; JS-set cookies can't be HttpOnly.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m sessionStorage
     [38;5;246mPer-tab, cleared on tab close. Lowest risk and simplest, but does not survive a browser restart.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
